OL,3,GNEWSACardboard tower sculpture toppled
OL,4,Aafter wind hits
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of a giant cardboard model has
OL,7,Ffallen victim to sea winds.
OL,9,FThe six-storey-high art installation,
OL,10,Finspired by Weston-Super-Mare's
OL,11,Fcrumbling Birnbeck pier, was put up on
OL,12,FSaturday by local people under the
OL,13,Finstruction of artist Olivier
OL,14,FGrossetete.
OL,16,FThe tower began to lean at about 07:00
OL,17,FBST on Sunday and had completely fallen
OL,18,Fdown by 11:00, project leaders said.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
