OL,3,GNEWSACardboard tower sculpture toppled
OL,4,Aafter wind hits
OL,5,
OL,6,FBosses ensured the site was safe so
OL,7,Fpeople could watch it happen. When it
OL,8,Ffinally fell, members of the the
OL,9,Fcommunity in the park helped jump on it
OL,10,Fand prepare it for transportation and
OL,11,Fits recycling, they added.
